15	\subsection{模型建立}
16	
17	\subsubsection{设备参数确定}
18	
19	在36吨/日产能下，各设备参数如下：碱性电解槽额定功率$P_{ALK}^{rated} = 10$ MW，产氢速率140 kg/h；质子交换膜电解槽额定功率$P_{PEM}^{rated} = 10$ MW，产氢速率160 kg/h；合成氨装置额定功率$P_{NH3}^{rated} = 0.75$ MW，产氨速率1.5 t/h。电氢氨装置总额定功率为：
20	\begin{equation}
21	P_{EHA}^{rated} = P_{ALK}^{rated} + P_{PEM}^{rated} + P_{NH3}^{rated} = 10 + 10 + 0.75 = 20.75 \text{ MW}
22	\end{equation}
23	
24	\subsubsection{功率平衡方程}
25	
26	每个时段$t$的功率平衡方程为：
27	\begin{equation}\label{eq:power_balance}
28	P_{wind}(t) + P_{pv}(t) + P_{buy}(t) = P_{EHA}^{rated} + P_{load}(t) + P_{sell}(t)
29	\end{equation}
30	
31	其中$P_{buy}(t) \geq 0$，$P_{sell}(t) \geq 0$，且同一时段不能同时购售电。定义净功率为：
32	\begin{equation}
33	P_{net}(t) = P_{wind}(t) + P_{pv}(t) - P_{EHA}^{rated} - P_{load}(t)
34	\end{equation}
35	
36	当$P_{net}(t) \geq 0$时，园区有余电上网，$P_{sell}(t) = P_{net}(t)$，$P_{buy}(t) = 0$；当$P_{net}(t) < 0$时，园区需从电网购电，$P_{buy}(t) = -P_{net}(t)$，$P_{sell}(t) = 0$。
37	
38	\subsubsection{电量与指标计算}
39	
40	日总用电量、新能源发电量、网购电量和上网电量分别为：
41	\begin{equation}
42	E_{total} = \sum_{t=1}^{24} [P_{EHA}^{rated} + P_{load}(t)] \cdot \Delta t, \quad E_{RE} = \sum_{t=1}^{24} [P_{wind}(t) + P_{pv}(t)] \cdot \Delta t
43	\end{equation}
44	\begin{equation}
45	E_{buy} = \sum_{t=1}^{24} P_{buy}(t) \cdot \Delta t, \quad E_{sell} = \sum_{t=1}^{24} P_{sell}(t) \cdot \Delta t
46	\end{equation}
47	
48	绿电直连三项指标定义为：
49	\begin{equation}\label{eq:R1}
50	R_1 = \frac{E_{total} - E_{sell} - E_{buy}}{E_{RE}} \quad (\text{要求} > 60\%)
51	\end{equation}
52	\begin{equation}\label{eq:R2}
53	R_2 = \frac{E_{RE} - E_{sell}}{E_{total}} \quad (\text{要求} > 30\%)
54	\end{equation}
55	\begin{equation}\label{eq:R3}
56	R_3 = \frac{E_{sell}}{E_{RE}} \quad (\text{要求} < 20\%)
57	\end{equation}
